  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "SkinnedMeshRendererBehaviour is a specialized renderer responsible for drawing 3D meshes deformed by skeletal animation using GPU-based linear blend skinning. It manages asynchronous loading of mesh geometry and associated skin/bone data from external URIs. Its core function involves calculating and updating joint transformation matrices every frame, which are uploaded to a dedicated WebGLTexture for shader consumption."
  },
